/*
 * A big gust of wind can try to push you off of the pier. Whitney and the npc fisher can try to save you.
 */
:: Fishing Pier Wind
<<silently>><<athleticsdifficulty 600 1200>><</silently>>
A violent gust of wind slams into you, threatening to throw you over the side.
<br><br>

<<if $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase is "alone">>
	<<link [[Brace yourself|Fishing Pier Wind Check Whitney Alone]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase is "idle">>
	<<link [[Brace yourself|Fishing Pier Wind Check Whitney Idle]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase is "bet">>
	<<link [[Brace yourself|Fishing Pier Wind Check Whitney Bet]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase is "fishing">>
	<<link [[Brace yourself|Fishing Pier Wind Check Fisher]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Brace yourself|Fishing Pier Wind Check]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Check
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You plant your feet and hold your balance against the wind.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You fail to keep your footing.</span> The wind tears you from the pier and throws you into the water.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Fishing Pier Wind Check Whitney Alone
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You plant your feet and hold your balance against the wind.</span> Whitney glances at you, "Don't slip," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says with a slight, mocking smile.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You fail to keep your footing.</span> Whitney's arm catches you at the waist and pulls you back onto your feet. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> still takes the opportunity to give your <<bottom>> a squeeze before <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> lets go. <<npcincr Whitney lust 2>><<glust>><<arousal 5>><<garousal>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Thank <<nnpc_him "Whitney">>|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Thank]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Thank <<nnpc_him "Whitney">> with a kiss|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Thank Kiss]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Fishing Pier Wind Check Whitney Idle
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You plant your feet and hold your balance against the wind.</span> Whitney gives you a look. "Don't slip," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says with a slight, mocking smile.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You fail to keep your footing,</span> but just as you are about to fall over, Whitney catches your wrist.

	<<if C.npc.Whitney.love gte 20 or random(1, 2) is 1>>
		<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> laughs, "careful, slut. Can't have you drowning on me." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pulls you back toward the railing, still smirking.
		<br><br>
		
		<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> seems to consider it for a moment, then <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> grip loosens. "Oops," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says flatly, and lets go. <<gstress>><<stress 4>>
		<br><br>

		<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
		<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Idle Fall]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Idle Fall
You go over the edge, plunging into the water below the pier. Above you, you can hear Whitney's friends laughing.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Check Fisher
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You plant your feet and hold your balance against the wind.</span>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if random(1, 2) is 1>>
		<span class="red">You fail to keep your footing,</span> but the <<person1>><<person>> next to you lunges towards you and grabs your arm before you go over the edge. <<stress 5>><<ggstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Fisher Save]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">You fail to keep your footing.</span> The wind tears you from the pier and throws you into the water. <<stress 5>><<ggstress>>
		<br><br>

		<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
		<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Thank
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"Thank you," you say quietly, still catching your breath.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Thanks, I guess," you say, steadying yourself. "I would've caught myself."
<<else>>
	"Thank you," you say, your heart still racing.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Don't make that a habit," Whitney mutters, turning back to the water.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Thank Kiss
<<effects>>

You turn to Whitney, kissing <<nnpc_him "Whitney">> briefly on the lips.
<br><br>

<<nnpc_He "Whitney">> goes still for a moment, then grins and leans into the kiss. <<nnpc_His "Whitney">> hands move to your waist,
<<if $worn.upper.name isnot "naked">>
	pulling you closer as <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> starts to slip <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> fingers under the edge of your $worn.upper.name.
<<else>>
	pulling you closer.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Accept|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Pull away|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Refuse]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex
<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<consensual>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<npc Whitney>><<person1>>
	<<set $enemyno to 1>>
	<<maninit>>
	Whitney pushes you against the railing, still kissing you as <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> hands work to remove your clothes.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate "<span class='red'>No one on the pier intervenes.</span>">>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Accept Sex Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<npcincr Whitney lust -20>>
	<<llust>>
	Whitney catches <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> breath, still pressed close. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pulls back just enough to look at you.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "alone">>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">><</link>>
<<elseif $finish is 1>>
	Whitney pulls back with a sharp breath, jaw tight. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> shrugs and turns back to <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> rod. "Fine. Your loss."
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<npcincr Whitney dom -1>>
	<<ldom>>
	You manage to shove Whitney back, away from you. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stumbles, catches <<nnpc_himself "Whitney">> on the railing.
	<br><br>

	"Fine." <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> stares at you for a moment, then picks up <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> gear and heads back down the pier without another glance.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "finished">>
	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Refuse
Whitney pulls back, <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> grip tightening on you.
<br><br>

<<if dangerEvent() and C.npc.Whitney.lust gte 20>>
	"You don't get to stop that," Whitney says, <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> voice dropping. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> pulls you back against <<nnpc_him "Whitney">>.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wind Whitney Alone Kiss Refuse Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	After a moment, <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> lets out a slow breath and loosens <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> grip. "Fine," <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> says, stepping back. <<nnpc_He "Whitney">> picks up <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> gear. "Just don't make me regret saving you."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Return to Fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><<run stopFishingProp()>><</link>>
<</if>>


