:: Fishing Pier Wind Check Whitney Bet
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You plant your feet and hold your balance against the wind.</span>
	<br><br>

	One of Whitney's friends lets out a chuckle. "I was worried you might fall off before you catch something."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You fail to keep your footing.</span> The wind tears you from the pier and throws you into the water. You hear Whitney's friends burst out laughing as you go over.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fellOff to true>>
	<<link [[Next|Sea Docks]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>


